---
description: Project rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- Always read PROJECT_SPEC.md before making changes and follow it.
- Use TypeScript strictly; no `any`.
- Use Supabase server client in Server Components/Actions, browser client only in client components.
- Every new table needs RLS policies matching the roles in the spec.
- Format all money with the shared formatZAR() helper.
- After finishing a task, list the files changed and anything I need to do manually (env vars, migrations).
- Ask before installing packages not listed in the spec.